    stage3_scv_inventory_noncanonical_and_stage2_struct_push_segv_2026-09-20, 1, "2026-11-09 native lane: fixed-by-rewrite (wait-verify). Part 2 (struct push SEGV) fixed in PR #1144. Part 1: the insertion sort with text < is gone; compile_source_inventory_sort_v1 is now a stable merge sort with byte-wise compile_source_inventory_identity_cmp_v1. Native repro with stage2_new4.exe of the exact sort shape over 3000 array-of-struct text entries: inv1=0 inv2=0 PASS (C:/dev/p3new/s3sanity/lane_native/invsort.out). Close after one stage3 inventory readback confirms canonical order."

